WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.573
Each input needs an agreed owner Daniel identifies who

00:00:04.599 --> 00:00:07.284
will supply each paper when it is needed and

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:10.731
where its current version will be kept He checks

00:00:10.771 --> 00:00:14.218
that the people involved can meet the plan If

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:17.823
several executives share his time he makes the capacity

00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:21.047
conflict visible instead of assuming that all requests can

00:00:21.139 --> 00:00:21.915
be completed
